    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "JIT help",
      "source_hash": 7254763807693352716,
      "context_hash": 7379461888752187174,
      "translation": "JIT 도움말",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "JIT": "JIT"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:26:23.282674Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "this is from ``pypy --jit help``",
      "source_hash": 1648797789493831345,
      "context_hash": 8001273469089474120,
      "translation": "이는 ``pypy --jit help``\\ 에서 가져온 것입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:26:23.645763Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Advanced JIT options",
      "source_hash": 14188057926496228958,
      "context_hash": 8034995176456563695,
      "translation": "고급 JIT 옵션",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "JIT": "JIT"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-01T21:26:23.264693Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "``<pypy> --jit`` [*options*] where *options* is a comma-separated list of ``OPTION=VALUE``:",
      "source_hash": 1630069198802600122,
      "context_hash": 1072003507045096876,
      "translation": "``<pypy> --jit`` [*options*]에서 *options*\\ 는 ``OPTION=VALUE``\\ 의 쉼표로 구분된 목록입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T21:41:18.539007Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "decay=N",
      "source_hash": 15056778964322694859,
      "context_hash": 7913553260416858285,
      "translation": "decay=N",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T21:41:08.118231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "amount to regularly decay counters by (0=none, 1000=max) (default 40).",
      "source_hash": 8545712257689323721,
      "context_hash": 4341109447727187931,
      "translation": "카운터를 정기적으로 감쇠시킬 양(0=없음, 1000=최대)(기본값 40)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T21:41:28.635140Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "This value is used to reduce the JIT counters every 32 minor collections, according to the formula ``val *= 1.0 - (decay / 1000)``.",
      "source_hash": 2535344263451649817,
      "context_hash": 10540356209527287075,
      "translation": "이 값은 32번의 마이너 컬렉션마다 다음 공식에 따라 JIT 카운터를 줄이는 데 사용됩니다: ``val *= 1.0 - (decay / 1000)``.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "JIT": "JIT"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T21:41:28.635141Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "This avoids JIT compilation of rare paths even on long-running programs.",
      "source_hash": 9428391534213375090,
      "context_hash": 7997412241756726168,
      "translation": "이는 오래 실행되는 프로그램에서도 드문 경로에 대한 JIT 컴파일을 피합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "JIT": "JIT"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T21:41:28.635141Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "disable_unrolling=N",
      "source_hash": 6358271231323716016,
      "context_hash": 11897921516027636472,
      "translation": "disable_unrolling=N",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T21:41:46.871078Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "after how many operations we should not unroll (default 200)",
      "source_hash": 17678783961215599375,
      "context_hash": 15227695205470376815,
      "translation": "몇 개의 연산 이후에 언롤(unroll)하지 않아야 하는지 (기본값 200)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T21:41:08.789915Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "enable_opts=N",
      "source_hash": 14975297120705863265,
      "context_hash": 16691729056110125739,
      "translation": "enable_opts=N",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T21:41:47.573588Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "INTERNAL USE ONLY (MAY NOT WORK OR LEAD TO CRASHES): optimizations to enable, or all = intbounds:rewrite:virtualize:string:pure:earlyforce:heap:unroll (default all)",
      "source_hash": 8303165764482540688,
      "context_hash": 4094230774630778599,
      "translation": "내부 사용 전용(작동하지 않거나 충돌을 유발할 수 있음): 활성화\\ 할 최적화, 또는 all = intbounds:rewrite:virtualize:string:pure:earlyforce:heap:unroll (기본값 all)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T21:42:00.962091Z",
      "issues": [
        "\"활성화\\ 할\"에 불필요한 역슬래시(\\)와 띄어쓰기가 남아 있어 부자연스럽고(\"활성화할\"이 맞는 표기), 나머지는 원문 의미와 기술 용어를 정확히 전달합니다."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "function_threshold=N",
      "source_hash": 2125337334355522922,
      "context_hash": 1996396899588972051,
      "translation": "function_threshold=N",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T21:41:57.728788Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "number of times a function must run for it to become traced from start (default 1619)",
      "source_hash": 16203197169792635853,
      "context_hash": 5018165230982732442,
      "translation": "함수가 시작부터 트레이싱\\ 되기 위해 실행되어야 하는 횟수(기본값 1619)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T21:42:05.595284Z",
      "issues": [
        "번역 내용 자체는 원문 의미를 정확히 전달하지만, \"트레이싱\\ 되기\"의 백슬래시가 텍스트에 그대로 노출되어 있어 독자에게는 오타나 조판 오류로 보일 수 있습니다(RST 이스케이프 목적이라면 렌더링 후 사라져야 함)."
      ]
    },
